<p>Australian police said they fatally shot Dezi Freeman in rural Victoria on Monday after finding the fugitive accused of killing two police officers and seriously wounding a third at a property in Porepunkah in August. Authorities said the shooting came after an hours-long standoff in bushland, and Victoria police chief commissioner Mike Bush said officers were justified in using force after Freeman did not surrender peacefully. The shooting brought to an end a seven-month search in northeastern Victoria that authorities had described as long and dangerous.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/L-S3IGp7JDJPrjNIYccm9O85ouszmdA8HL9c-NwqRJ4ho3beg6g6JSRdGN1vP1QwpbFdmguS_5l7oJ__eHvq1Eq-f4T7TKAN2YJktFX6f6tMAwHiojNq81fptQDiGHYApQqjIM1tigtpqCh3m59dxDyexwVMC8SSzxjQGjnmfQ' alt='Police-related image used in coverage of the fatal shooting that ended the seven-month search in Victoria.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Operational timing: The Guardian said police announced the fatal shooting shortly after 8.30am on Monday.</li><li>Search scale: SCMP and DW said hundreds of officers took part over several months in what was described as one of Australia’s largest-ever manhunts.</li><li>National profile: DW said Freeman became one of the country’s most-wanted criminals during the search.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Victoria police chief commissioner Mike Bush: Bush said investigators had previously followed evidence suggesting Freeman may have taken his own life, but they kept pursuing all leads because professional investigators must stay open to every possible outcome. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/mar/30/dezi-freeman-update-news-shot-dead-by-police-australia-fugitive-victoria-porepunkah-shooting-live-updates-latest-ntwnfb'>The Guardian</a>)</li><li>Victorian premier Jacinta Allan: Allan said &quot;an evil man is dead and it’s over,&quot; underscoring the relief that the hunt had ended. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/mar/30/dezi-freeman-update-news-shot-dead-by-police-australia-fugitive-victoria-porepunkah-shooting-live-updates-latest-ntwnfb'>The Guardian</a>)</li><li>Victoria police: Police initially said they believed the man shot dead after the standoff was Freeman. (<a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/australian-police-fatally-shoot-suspect-3-hour-standoff-131532407'>ABC News</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/mar/30/dezi-freeman-update-news-shot-dead-by-police-australia-fugitive-victoria-porepunkah-shooting-live-updates-latest-ntwnfb'>Dezi Freeman shooting live updates: Victorian premier says ‘an evil man is dead and it’s over’ after Australian fugitive killed by police</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/asia/australasia/article/3348332/australian-police-killer-shot-dead-after-7-month-manhunt'>Australian police killer shot dead after 7-month manhunt</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/australia-police-shoot-dead-man-wanted-for-killing-2-officers/a-76587251'>Australia police shoot dead man wanted for killing 2 officers</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/australian-police-fatally-shoot-suspect-3-hour-standoff-131532407'>Australian police fatally shoot a suspect in a 3-hour standoff after 2 officers killed</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/cjw8vqnlzxvo'>How Australia’s seven-month-long manhunt came to an end</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-03-30/vic-dezi-freeman-search-fatal-shooting/106510112'>Police fatally shoot Dezi Freeman, a fugitive who was on the run for seven months after he killed two police officers and seriously injured another in a shooting in Porepunkah, Victoria, Australia, at a property in northeast Victoria, Australia. (ABC News)</a> - abc.net.au</li></ul>